' 10/16/2026: class 6: i/lo- (im line 77 adds "i/" prefix)
{:3054}
' 10/29/2026: the name is in a$ (an$ is the value just typed), and 77 only
' loads the module: run it at 4500, where an i/lo- module starts (i/lo.on
' runs them there). 77 and 4500 are written {$37}7 and {$34}500: the preface
' has no 77 (C64List wrote [77]), and 4500 is a line in no file here
    lm=a:a$="lo-"+a$:dr=5:on -(p1$<>"i/"+a$) gosub {$37}7:gosub {$34}500:goto {:3002}
